      "reference": "../references/customer-registration-panel2.png",
      "viewport": { "width": 1440, "height": 900 },
      "additionalViewports": [{ "name": "mobile", "width": 390, "height": 844 }],
      "waitForSelector": "#signup-panel",
      "_note": "The signup panel only becomes visible after clicking #tab-signup-btn - UI Judge is non-interactive by design (never clicks/submits), so this entry audits the DOM as-loaded (login panel visible). A genuine visual score for the post-click state needs a click-through screenshot fed into src/lib/imageUtils.js's pixelDiff() directly, or a future interactive-state extension to the tool."
    },
    {
